  "slug": "our-favorite-most-amazing-guacamole",
  "name": "Our Favorite Most Amazing Guacamole",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "This simple homemade guacamole recipe is great for weeknight dinners with tacos, burritos, or quesadillas--or serve it at your next party with a big bowl of tortilla chips.",
  "cuisine": null,
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Place avocados in a medium bowl and squeeze in lime juice. Add tomatoes, shallot, cilantro, garlic, salt, and pepper. Mash with an immersion blender or a sturdy fork until avocado is mashed and ingredients are combined. Stir gently and serve immediately."
    }
  ],
